## Tell Tor this is a bridge
BridgeRelay 1

## Port for Tor traffic (use 443 or 80 to look like HTTPS/HTTP)
ORPort 443

## obfs4 pluggable transport
ServerTransportPlugin obfs4 exec /usr/bin/obfs4proxy
ServerTransportListenAddr obfs4 0.0.0.0:9002

## Don't publish to the main directory
PublishServerDescriptor 0

## Safety settings
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
SocksPort 0

## Contact and nickname
ContactInfo your@email.com
Nickname MyBridge

## Bandwidth
BandwidthRate 5 MB
BandwidthBurst 10 MB

## Logging
Log notice file /var/log/tor/notices.log

## Data directory
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor